// The protocol between a RELAY and a WORKER.
//
// # Why this is not one of the plugin's protos
//
// Everything under `plugins/cluster/proto/` is materialised into the consuming
// project: tables, services the project serves, clients it calls. This
// conversation has neither end there. A relay is a separate process and a
// worker is somebody's laptop; the project never speaks it and would have to
// generate — and register — a facade for a service it has nothing to do with.
//
// So it is a plain gRPC contract with no w17 annotations, generated by buf into
// this package and compiled into the relay and the worker SDK, which are the
// only two programs that know it exists.

